\author{nimarasekh}
\author{markwilliams}
\title{Work relating to synthetic quasicoherence}
\import{stt-macros}
\meta{source}{\PR{205}}
\meta{source}{\PR{210}}
\meta{source}{\PR{212}}

\ul{
\li{Thanks to [Mark](markwilliams) for getting [his PR](stt-00TD) on
    the basics of quasicoherence out just in time for the workshop.}
  \li{[Nima](nimarasekh) worked on the fact that Quasicoherence of an algebra implies the monotonicity of every endomap (\ref{stt-00TV}),
  and also that Phoa's principle implies synthetic quasicoherence for finite-free algebras (SQCP) (\ref{stt-00TC}).
    \em{Monotonicity of endomaps} is a condition that has since been developed under the name of [directedness](Synthetic.Directedness)}
}
